{"resourceIdentifier":"5203","resourceName":"Luoding BCCY New Power CO., Ltd. MSW biogas to electricity generation project","description":"Luoding BCCY New Power CO., Ltd. MSW biogas to electricity generation project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Luoding MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as the Luoding landfill site), in Kangren Village, Luoding City, Yunfu City, Guangdong Province, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Luoding BCCY New Energy CO., Ltd. (hereafter referred to as the project owner)\r\nThe project has a total designed capacity 2MW (2*1MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the China Southern Power Grid (CSPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 86,250MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project is 44,555tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 445,554tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period（from 28-Dec-2022 to 27-Dec-2032）","location":{"latitude":22.813611,"longitude":111.550274},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-09-02","endExclusive":"2024-10-03","endInclusive":"2024-10-02"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5203"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"44555"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME"